From 79c0ec848e42aa959d9e39abe429c2facbe5864b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dyafa Marketing <marketing@dyafa.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 16:25:27 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Snap Pixel + Conversions API for Fandaqah 360

- assets/js/fq-snap.js: Snap Pixel in every PHP copy (via build-php.py). PAGE_VIEW, VIEW_CONTENT (50% scroll / 30 s),
  CUSTOM_EVENT_1 CTA click, CUSTOM_EVENT_2 form open, CUSTOM_EVENT_3 form start, SIGN_UP only on a confirmed lead,
  client_dedup_id = submission_id. Respects Global Privacy Control. One value to fill: PIXEL_ID.
- api/snap-capi.php + api/lead.php: one server SIGN_UP per lead the CRM accepts, event_id = submission_id (dedup),
  hashed em/ph/fn/ln, Cloudflare client IP, _scid cookie, ScCid. Sent after the visitor is answered; partial leads skipped.
- api/config.php: snap pixel_id / token / test_event_code (env vars preferred).
- tools/snap-offline-capi.py: CRM stages -> qualified CUSTOM_EVENT_4, opportunity CUSTOM_EVENT_5, customer SUBSCRIBE (SAR).
- site.js: ScCid recorded in attribution touches.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
